# Mail: the list, searching it as you type, reading a thread, turning it
# into a todo, and asking Greed's agent which mail needs an answer. The
# mail is site/media/mail, served by a Dovecot of the recording's own, on
# the morning the demo profile fixes.
# command: greed mail
# needs: mail
size 1280 800
fps 30
typing 0.03
show-keys
hide
wait-for Tomato seeds
show
wait 0.6

caption Mail from every account in one list, newest first
wait 2

caption Searching as you type
keys /
type deploy
wait 1.2
keys enter
wait 0.6

caption Reading the thread
keys enter
wait-for Jonas
wait 2.2

caption A todo from it, due when you say, in your notes' inbox
keys T
wait 0.8
type thursday
wait 0.4
shot mail-todo
keys enter
wait 1.6
keys q
keys alt-1
wait 0.8

caption Asking the agent about what's in front of you
keys space i n
type Greed
keys enter
type project
keys enter
type which of these need an answer from me this week?
keys alt-enter
wait-for something to pay
wait 3
shot mail
wait 0.5
